Subject: [PATCH 225/297] Meridian: connect an agent in one click; Copy Last
 Answer; 0.6.21

Connect gives the agent control unless the person chose a level. An agent
connected earlier asks once in the browser; a no closes the socket. The
terminal menu copies the agent's whole last answer. The sidebar toggle sits
on the traffic lights' line, and at the edge in full screen.

